panic: a blocking await ran inside an async task: an io.await in a non-io.async function, JoinHandle.await, or a std/async combinator (join_all/race/any/timeout) was called from a spawned or awaited task. That nests the event loop and can deadlock. Make the function an io.async future and await it; to race tasks from inside a task, poll is_finished() and await yield().
